{"id":1812,"date":"2016-06-24T09:43:51","date_gmt":"2016-06-24T09:43:51","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=1812"},"modified":"2017-06-22T06:53:32","modified_gmt":"2017-06-22T06:53:32","slug":"amsterdam2016","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/","title":{"rendered":"Amsterdam2016"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a title=\"Amsterdam2016\" href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/\">The last SWAT4LS was held in <strong>Amsterdam, NL<\/strong>, <strong>5-8th December 2016<\/strong><\/a>. It has been a full conference for the second time. SWAT4LS 2016 comprised a tutorials day (5th), main conference (6th and 7th), and a Hackathon day (8th). All events was held in the Netherlands Cancer Institute in Amsterdam.<\/p>\n<p>The 2016 SWAT4LS conference is the ninth meeting in the series and has provided the same open, vibrant and well organised environment that has previously brought together researchers, developers, and users, from many fields to discuss goals, current limits and real experiences in the use of Semantic Web technologies in health care and the life sciences.<\/p>\n<p>Read more about <a title=\"Clinical interpretation of Variants in Cancer at SWAT4LS 2016\" href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/clinical-interpretation-of-variants-in-cancer-at-swat4ls-2016\/\">Clinical interpretation of Variants in Cancer at SWAT4LS 2016.<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Read more about our\u00a0<a title=\"Social event: visiting the Amsterdam Light Festival\" href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/social-event-visiting-the-amsterdam-light-festival\/\">Social event: visiting the Amsterdam Light Festival<\/a>.<br \/>\n<a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/amsterdam2016\/social-event-visiting-the-amsterdam-light-festival\/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-2070 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/upl